  "subject": "情报科学研究科_情报基础数学",
  "text": "复平面领域 $D = \\{z : |z| < 1\\}$ 中，$f(z) = \\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty} a_n z^n$ 正则，且对所有 $z \\in D$ 有 $|f(z)| < 1$。证明对所有 $n = 0, 1, 2, \\ldots$ 有 $|a_n| \\leq 1$。",
  "knowledge_points": [
    "Cauchy不等式",
    "幂级数",
    "正则函数",
    "最大模原理",
    "系数估计"
  ],
  "question_type": "复变函数系数界的证明",
  "method": [
    "Cauchy积分公式",
    "Cauchy不等式",
    "极限论证"
  ],
  "solution_steps": [
    "利用 Cauchy 积分公式表示系数",
    "应用模的性质和路径积分的上界估计",
    "利用给定条件 $|f(z)| < 1$ 在 $D$ 中成立",
    "对参数取极限得到结论"
  ],
  "math_structure": {
    "type": "coefficient_bound_estimate",
    "template": "若 $f(z) = \\sum a_n z^n$ 在 $|z| \\leq r$ 上正则，$|f(z)| \\leq M(r)$，则 $|a_n| \\leq \\frac{M(r)}{r^n}$",
    "variable_count": 2
  },
  "difficulty": 3,
  "answer": [
    {
      "label": "系数界估计的证明",
      "steps": [
        "由 Cauchy 积分公式，对任意 $0 < r < 1$：",
        "$$a_n = \\frac{1}{2\\pi i} \\oint_{|z|=r} \\frac{f(z)}{z^{n+1}} \\, dz$$",
        "对上式取模，利用路径积分上界：",
        "$$|a_n| = \\left| \\frac{1}{2\\pi i} \\oint_{|z|=r} \\frac{f(z)}{z^{n+1}} \\, dz \\right| \\leq \\frac{1}{2\\pi} \\oint_{|z|=r} \\frac{|f(z)|}{|z|^{n+1}} \\, |dz|$$",
        "$$\\leq \\frac{1}{2\\pi} \\cdot \\max_{|z|=r} |f(z)| \\cdot \\frac{1}{r^{n+1}} \\cdot 2\\pi r = \\frac{\\max_{|z|=r} |f(z)|}{r^n}$$",
        "由题设条件，$|f(z)| < 1$ 在 $|z| = r$ 上成立（因为 $f$ 在 $|z| \\leq r \\subset D$ 上正则），故：",
        "$$\\max_{|z|=r} |f(z)| \\leq 1$$",
        "因此：",
        "$$|a_n| \\leq \\frac{1}{r^n}$$",
        "令 $r \\to 1^-$，由于不等式对所有 $0 < r < 1$ 成立，取极限得：",
        "$$|a_n| \\leq 1$$",
        "（注：实际上 $\\max_{|z|=r} |f(z)| < 1$ 对 $r < 1$ 严格成立，极限过程中不等号成为非严格的）"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "practice_questions": [
    {
      "text": "设 $f(z) = \\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty} a_n z^n$ 在 $|z| < 1$ 上正则，$|f(z)| \\leq M$（$M > 0$ 为常数）。证明 $|a_n| \\leq \\frac{2M}{(1-r)^{n+1}}$ 对所有 $0 < r < 1$ 成立。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "Cauchy不等式",
        "参数化界"
      ],
      "question_type": "系数界估计",
      "method": [
        "Cauchy积分公式"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "应用 Cauchy 不等式的标准形式"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "parametric_coefficient_bound",
        "template": "$$|a_n| \\leq \\frac{M}{r^n}$$对所有 $0 < r < 1$",
        "variable_count": 2
      },
      "difficulty": 2,
      "estimated_minutes": 8,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "证明",
          "steps": [
            "由 Cauchy 积分公式：$|a_n| \\leq \\frac{\\max_{|z|=r} |f(z)|}{r^n} \\leq \\frac{M}{r^n}$",
            "这对任意 $0 < r < 1$ 成立"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "osaka-2008-52d6e2684f-q03-practice-01",
      "school": "大阪大学",
      "year": "2008"
    },
    {
      "text": "设 $f(z) = \\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty} a_n z^n$ 在 $|z| < 2$ 上正则，$|f(z)| < 3$ 对所有 $|z| < 2$。证明 $|a_n| \\leq \\frac{3}{2^n}$。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "Cauchy不等式",
        "缩放"
      ],
      "question_type": "系数界",
      "method": [
        "Cauchy不等式"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "在 $|z| = r < 2$ 上应用 Cauchy 不等式，令 $r \\to 2^-$"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "coefficient_bound",
        "template": "$$|a_n| \\leq \\frac{3}{r^n}，r \\to 2^-$$",
        "variable_count": 2
      },
      "difficulty": 2,
      "estimated_minutes": 8,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "证明",
          "steps": [
            "由 Cauchy 不等式，对 $0 < r < 2$：$|a_n| \\leq \\frac{3}{r^n}$",
            "令 $r \\to 2^-$，得 $|a_n| \\leq \\frac{3}{2^n}$"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "osaka-2008-52d6e2684f-q03-practice-02",
      "school": "大阪大学",
      "year": "2008"
    },
    {
      "text": "若 $f(z)$ 在 $|z| < 1$ 上正则且 $f(0) = 0$，$|f(z)| < |z|$。证明 $|f(z)| \\leq \\frac{|z|}{2}$。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "Schwarz引理",
        "系数估计"
      ],
      "question_type": "Schwarz引理应用",
      "method": [
        "Schwarz引理"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "考虑 $g(z) = f(z)/z$"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "schwarz_lemma",
        "template": "若 $f(0) = 0, |f(z)| < |z|$，则可应用 Schwarz 引理的推广",
        "variable_count": 1
      },
      "difficulty": 3,
      "estimated_minutes": 10,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "证明",
          "steps": [
            "定义 $g(z) = f(z)/z$（$z \\neq 0$），在 $z = 0$ 处定义 $g(0) = f'(0)$",
            "则 $g$ 在 $|z| < 1$ 上正则",
            "由条件 $|f(z)| < |z|$，对 $0 < |z| < 1$ 有 $|g(z)| = |f(z)|/|z| < 1$",
            "由最大模原理，$|g(z)| \\leq 1$ 对所有 $|z| < 1$ 成立",
            "因此 $|f(z)| = |z| \\cdot |g(z)| \\leq |z|$",
            "（要证明更强的 $|f(z)| \\leq |z|/2$ 需要额外信息）"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "osaka-2008-52d6e2684f-q03-practice-03",
      "school": "大阪大学",
      "year": "2008"
    }
